   "html": "<form action=\"https://www.zoller.info/ca-fr/entreprises/carriere/candidature?tx_form_formframework%5Baction%5D=perform&amp;tx_form_formframework%5Bcontroller%5D=FormFrontend&amp;cHash=3277dfb308f2a4907c9567d860ebc94e#bewerbungsformular-4080\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080\" method=\"post\"> <div><input name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][__state]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"TzozOToiVFlQTzNcQ01TXEZvcm1cRG9tYWluXFJ1bnRpbWVcRm9ybVN0YXRlIjoyOntzOjI1OiIAKgBsYXN0RGlzcGxheWVkUGFnZUluZGV4IjtpOjA7czoxMzoiACoAZm9ybVZhbHVlcyI7YTowOnt9fQ==e1fa0a6fff7432dcbaca0174b96641dc4234cdba\"/><input name=\"tx_form_formframework[__trustedProperties]\" type=\"hidden\" value='{\"bewerbungsformular-4080\":{\"text-1\":1,\"text-4\":1,\"YDJp2R9KMn6cV37sCgTvjwkxoe\":1,\"text-2\":1,\"text-3\":1,\"email-1\":1,\"telephone-1\":1,\"text-5\":1,\"text-6\":1,\"fileupload-1\":{\"name\":1,\"type\":1,\"tmp_name\":1,\"error\":1,\"size\":1},\"fileupload-2\":{\"name\":1,\"type\":1,\"tmp_name\":1,\"error\":1,\"size\":1},\"fileupload-3\":{\"name\":1,\"type\":1,\"tmp_name\":1,\"error\":1,\"size\":1},\"textarea-1\":1,\"checkbox-1\":1,\"__currentPage\":1}}e026be6c5c319e0416580eda8e93d0ca3dede50e'/> </div> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-4\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-1\">Candidature spontanée pour un poste en tant que <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-4\">Domaine <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-4\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-4]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <input aria-hidden=\"true\" data-id=\"YDJp2R9KMn6cV37sCgTvjwkxoe\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-YDJp2R9KMn6cV37sCgTvjwkxoe\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][YDJp2R9KMn6cV37sCgTvjwkxoe]\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\"/> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-3\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-2\">Prénom <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input autocomplete=\"given-name\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-2\" maxlength=\"100\" minlength=\"1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-2]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-3\">Nom <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-3]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-email-1\">Adresse e-mail <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-email-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][email-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-telephone-1\">Numéro de téléphone <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-telephone-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][telephone-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"tel\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-5\">Rue/Numéro</label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-5\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-5]\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-6\">Code postal/Ville</label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-6\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-6]\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-1\"> <div class=\"clearfix\"> <p>Téléchargement de vos documents : Vos documents doivent être joints au format PDF et ne doivent pas dépasser une taille totale de 10 Mo. Le téléchargement et la transmission des fichiers joints démarreront lors de l'envoi de ce formulaire.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-1\">Lettre de motivation (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-2\">Curriculum vitae (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-2\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-2]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-3\">Certificats (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-3]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-textarea-1\">Votre message</label> <div class=\"input\"> <textarea class=\"xxlarge form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-textarea-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][textarea-1]\"></textarea> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-2\"> <div class=\"clearfix\"> <p>Veuillez noter : ZOLLER conservera les données que vous fournissez dans le but de sélectionner un candidat approprié. Vos données personnelles seront stockées et traitées conformément au Règlement général sur la protection des données (RGPD). Vos informations seront traitées de manière strictement confidentielle et cryptées lors de la transmission électronique. Elles ne seront pas transmises à des tiers. Si nous ne parvenons pas à trouver un poste approprié pour votre profil, nous supprimerons les données que vous avez soumises au plus tard après 2 mois.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-checkbox-1\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][checkbox-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-checkbox-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][checkbox-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>Vous acceptez que les données saisies ci-dessus soient utilisées pour traiter votre demande à des fins commerciales et transmises aux agences commerciales ou représentants commerciaux compétents. Vous pouvez vous opposer au traitement de vos données à tout moment et sans indication de motifs en écrivant à datenschutz@zoller.info. <span class=\"required\">*</span> </span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <div class=\"actions\"> <nav class=\"form-navigation\"> <div class=\"btn-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\"> <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\"> <span class=\"btn-group next submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][__currentPage]\" type=\"submit\" value=\"1\"> Envoyer un e-mail </button> </span> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </form>",
